# Runtime plugin installs (TPM manages these) and per-machine app state.
# Were previously tracked; now ignored so chezmoi doesn't try to delete them.
# Whole ~/.tmux is runtime-managed (TPM clones plugins into it); the legacy
# symlink_dot_tmux pointed at a Linux-only path and breaks on macOS.
.tmux
.tmux/**
.local/share/lutris/**
.local/share/nvim/lazy/**
